    <diylc.misc.Label>
      <name>L66</name>
      <point x="8.55" y="3.05"/>
      <text>R1 AVDD-AIN1 and R2 AIN1-AGND: 1 k 0.1 %, a matched pair</text>
      <font name="Dialog" size="8" style="0"/>
      <color hex="000000"/>
      <center>false</center>
      <horizontalAlignment>LEFT</horizontalAlignment>
      <verticalAlignment>CENTER</verticalAlignment>
      <orientation>DEFAULT</orientation>
    </diylc.misc.Label>
    <diylc.misc.Label>
      <name>L67</name>
      <point x="8.55" y="3.19"/>
      <text>(any equal pair 680 R - 2 k; never mixed values). AIN1 then sits</text>
      <font name="Dialog" size="8" style="0"/>
      <color hex="000000"/>
      <center>false</center>
      <horizontalAlignment>LEFT</horizontalAlignment>
      <verticalAlignment>CENTER</verticalAlignment>
      <orientation>DEFAULT</orientation>
    </diylc.misc.Label>
    <diylc.misc.Label>
      <name>L68</name>
      <point x="8.55" y="3.33"/>
      <text>at ~1.65 V, the other half of the bridge.</text>
      <font name="Dialog" size="8" style="0"/>
      <color hex="000000"/>
      <center>false</center>
      <horizontalAlignment>LEFT</horizontalAlignment>
      <verticalAlignment>CENTER</verticalAlignment>
      <orientation>DEFAULT</orientation>
    </diylc.misc.Label>
    <diylc.misc.Label>
      <name>L69</name>
      <point x="8.55" y="3.47"/>
      <text>Every pin also goes through to its strip below (rows A-H).</text>
      <font name="Dialog" size="8" style="0"/>
      <color hex="000000"/>
      <center>false</center>
      <horizontalAlignment>LEFT</horizontalAlignment>
      <verticalAlignment>CENTER</verticalAlignment>
      <orientation>DEFAULT</orientation>
    </diylc.misc.Label>
    <diylc.misc.Label>
      <name>L70</name>
      <point x="1.0" y="3.6"/>
      <text>Right-plate carrier: the same board with R1 R2 R3 R4 (CS &lt;- D7, D8, D9, A2); leave BUS OUT empty.</text>
      <font name="Dialog" size="9" style="0"/>
      <color hex="000000"/>
      <center>false</center>
      <horizontalAlignment>LEFT</horizontalAlignment>
      <verticalAlignment>CENTER</verticalAlignment>
      <orientation>DEFAULT</orientation>
    </diylc.misc.Label>
    <diylc.misc.Label>
      <name>L71</name>
      <point x="1.0" y="3.75"/>
      <text>Each cell has 3 wires; its JST at the cradle joins them to a shielded cable. White E+ -&gt; N, black E- -&gt; O,</text>
      <font name="Dialog" size="9" style="0"/>
      <color hex="000000"/>
      <center>false</center>
      <horizontalAlignment>LEFT</horizontalAlignment>
      <verticalAlignment>CENTER</verticalAlignment>
      <orientation>DEFAULT</orientation>
    </diylc.misc.Label>
    <diylc.misc.Label>
      <name>L72</name>
      <point x="1.0" y="3.9"/>
      <text>red S -&gt; P. Grey is the cable's shield (drain wire), not a cell wire: GND on strip O here, nothing at the cradle.</text>
      <font name="Dialog" size="9" style="0"/>
      <color hex="000000"/>
      <center>false</center>
      <horizontalAlignment>LEFT</horizontalAlignment>
      <verticalAlignment>CENTER</verticalAlignment>
      <orientation>DEFAULT</orientation>
    </diylc.misc.Label>
    <diylc.misc.Label>
      <name>L73</name>
      <point x="1.0" y="4.05"/>
      <text>Pale circles = cut the strip at that hole (from the copper side; check with a meter).</text>
      <font name="Dialog" size="9" style="0"/>
      <color hex="000000"/>
      <center>false</center>
      <horizontalAlignment>LEFT</horizontalAlignment>
      <verticalAlignment>CENTER</verticalAlignment>
      <orientation>DEFAULT</orientation>
    </diylc.misc.Label>
    <diylc.misc.Label>
      <name>L74</name>
      <point x="1.0" y="4.2"/>
      <text>Fit all links before the breakouts: they run underneath. Breakouts pins down, header spacer under.</text>
      <font name="Dialog" size="9" style="0"/>
      <color hex="000000"/>
      <center>false</center>
      <horizontalAlignment>LEFT</horizontalAlignment>
      <verticalAlignment>CENTER</verticalAlignment>
      <orientation>DEFAULT</orientation>
    </diylc.misc.Label>
    <diylc.misc.Label>
      <name>L75</name>
      <point x="1.0" y="4.35"/>
      <text>Mount with ~3 mm nylon standoffs in strip I or M. Full steps: docs/harness.md.</text>
      <font name="Dialog" size="9" style="0"/>
      <color hex="000000"/>
      <center>false</center>
      <horizontalAlignment>LEFT</horizontalAlignment>
